# Next-gen UX

Follow `.cursor/skills/next-gen-ux/SKILL.md` and `docs/UX_DESIGN_SYSTEM_REVIEW.md`.

- One primary (studio) CTA per screen; quieter secondary actions.
- One brand selector (shell header only). P0 baseline locked — see `docs/UX_DESIGN_SYSTEM_REVIEW.md` §22.
- Keep `AppShell` mounted while page content loads.
- Human copy only — no models, tokens, or pipeline jargon.
- Success, error, empty, and dirty-form states are required, not polish.
- Reuse `PageLayout`, `PageHeader`, `.surface-panel`. Do not add a second design system.
